## Goal

While the card creator holds unsaved work, every in-app way off `/creator` raises its existing `UnsavedNote`. "Discard them" makes the move and "Keep editing" stays. This covers:
- the queue's move to a found match;
- a challenge toast's Accept, and the toast's follow of an outgoing challenge;
- any `navigate()` call;
- the browser's Back and Forward (`popstate`).

A clean creator moves freely on every path, and the reload and BackLink prompts are unchanged. A held queue move leaves nothing stuck, and a held challenge stays on its toast so it can be accepted again. A new ruling, R1754000, records this and amends R1484000.

